# Runesword's effects are about the damage its creature deals from the time the ability resolved on (CR 611.2c): Bot1's
# attacking Triskelion pings Bot2's Hill Giant before Runesword's ability resolves, so the Giant, dying to Shock later
# that turn, goes to the graveyard; the Grizzly Bears it kills in combat afterwards are exiled instead of dying. Twiddle
# untaps Runesword for a second activation on the same creature that turn, whose effects add nothing to the first's but
# the second +2/+0.
